WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.056
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Improve Your CV with AI.

2
00:00:06.356 --> 00:00:11.377
Make your CV stronger with clear action words. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:18.428
Step one. Paste one sentence from your CV. Do not include phone numbers or addresses.

4
00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:25.810
Step two. Ask the AI to improve it. It uses strong action words like taught and improved.

5
00:00:26.817 --> 00:00:32.911
Step three. Check the facts. Only keep things that are true. Never invent numbers or jobs.

6
00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:39.486
Step four. Put the final line in your CV. Be ready to explain it in an interview.

7
00:00:40.483 --> 00:00:44.343
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.281
Improve three lines of your CV.

9
00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:50.335
Remove any false or unsure facts.

10
00:00:50.635 --> 00:00:52.658
Practise saying each line aloud.

11
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:53.971
Well done!

